    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="23.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAs">II As</ref> 23.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gif hit sy wæter, ðæt he gedufe oþre healfe elne on þam rape; gif hit sy ysenordale, beon ðreo niht, ær mon þa hond undó.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if the ordeal is by water he shall sink to a depth of one-and-a-half ells on the rope. If the ordeal is by [hot] iron three days shall elapse before the hand is unwrapped.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gif hit sy wæter, þæt he gedufe ðreo healf elne on ðæm rape; gif hit sy isen, syn ðreo nihte, ær mon ða hand ondó.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
